  "solution": {
    "text": "Condition <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn></math> for all logs to be defined<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2,7</mn></math><br />Since,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br />So the numbers are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> fourth term <math><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>",
